sequenceDiagram
    participant AoC as Advent of Code Website
    participant Cache as Local Cache
    participant Parser as Problem Parser
    participant Strategy as Strategy Analyzer
    participant Learning as Learning System
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant Attempts as Attempts Directory
    participant Executor as Solution Executor
    participant Submit as Submission Manager

    Note over Cache: Problem Directory Structure:<br/>years/YYYY/dayXX/<br/>- attempts/<br/>- examples/<br/>- input.txt<br/>- problem.txt<br/>- problem.html<br/>- problem.examples.txt<br/>- problem_meta.json

    alt Cache exists
        Cache->>Parser: Load cached problem.html
    else No cache
        AoC->>Cache: Fetch problem text
        Cache->>Cache: Save HTML & metadata
        Cache->>Parser: Pass HTML
    end

    Parser->>Parser: Extract examples from HTML
    Parser->>Cache: Save examples to .examples.txt
    Parser->>Parser: parse_problem_text()
    Parser->>Strategy: Analyze problem characteristics
    Strategy->>Strategy: get_strategies_for_problem()
    Strategy->>Strategy: create_strategy_prompt()

    Strategy->>Learning: Get problem type
    Learning->>Learning: Select top models by role:<br/>1. Primary (Solution Generation)<br/>2. Reviewer (Solution Improvement)<br/>3. Validator (Solution Verification)

    Learning->>LLM: Pass selected models and strategies
    Note over LLM: Prompt includes:<br/>1. Problem description<br/>2. Examples<br/>3. Parsing guidance<br/>4. Strategy guidance<br/>5. Implementation requirements<br/>6. Final question

    loop For each primary model
        LLM->>LLM: Generate solution
        LLM->>Attempts: Record attempt immediately
        Note over Attempts: Attempt includes:<br/>1. Model code (using 'input.txt')<br/>2. Prompt used<br/>3. Model info<br/>4. Generation metrics<br/>5. Raw response<br/>6. Applied strategies / execution results
        
        loop For each validator model
            LLM->>LLM: Validate solution
        end

        alt Solution valid
            Learning->>Learning: Update model performance metrics:<br/>1. Success rate<br/>2. Response time<br/>3. Code quality<br/>4. Cost efficiency
        else Solution invalid
            Learning->>Learning: Record validation failure
        end
    end

    alt No consensus
        loop For each reviewer model
            LLM->>LLM: Attempt solution improvement
            Learning->>Learning: Record improvement impact
        end
    end

    LLM-->>Executor: Best validated solution
    
    alt Solution exists
        Executor->>Executor: Run tests
        alt Tests pass
            Executor->>Submit: Submit solution
            Submit->>AoC: Simulated answer submission
            AoC-->>Submit: Simulated response
            Submit->>Learning: Update strategy effectiveness
        end
    end
